+// Ray tracing performance presets (Graphics > Ray tracing > Performance).
+// "Performance" turns on the levers that save the most for the least visible
+// change (DLSS CNN model, solid foliage for sky rays, lighter sky denoiser, motion
+// of still models from depth); "Full picture" turns every lever off again (the
+// default image). Each lever is also a saved setting of its own (hwrtdlsscnn,
