@@ -0,0 +1,45 @@
+NGX gateway compile chain (x64)
+================================
+
+Selected library (this SDK, NVIDIA DLSS 310.9.1, API 0x15):
+  third_party/NVIDIA-DLSS/lib/Windows_x86_64/x64/nvsdk_ngx_s.lib
+  Size ~3.78 MiB. Static CRT. Link the DLL with MSVC /MT.
+
+Not selected, and why:
+  nvsdk_ngx_d.lib          /MD + VC++ redistributable. Unused for an isolated DLL.
+  nvsdk_ngx_*_dbg*.lib     debug CRT. Unused for this probe.
+  nvsdk_ngx_*iterator*.lib iterator-debug CRT variants. Unused.
+  vs2010 / vs2012 / vs2013 older toolsets. Unused.
+  nvsdk_ngx_khr_*.lib      Khronos/OpenCL-oriented wrapper. Unused (we use Vulkan).
+  nvsdk_ngx_uwp_*.lib      UWP. Unused.
+
+Runtime:
+  lib/Windows_x86_64/rel/nvngx_dlss.dll  (snippet, copied next to sauer_ngx.dll in bin64/ngx-hdr)
+  nvngx.dll from the NVIDIA driver (DriverStore / System32). Not copied.
+
+Headers used by the DLL:
+  third_party/NVIDIA-DLSS/include/nvsdk_ngx_vk.h
+  nvsdk_ngx_helpers.h, nvsdk_ngx_helpers_vk.h
+  src/include/vulkan/vulkan.h (existing engine headers)
+
+MSVC (portable tree in third_party\msvc as of 2026-09-16):
+  cl.exe / link.exe from MSVC 14.44.17.14 (Hostx64/x64)
+  Windows SDK 10.0.26100 via portable-msvc.py
+  Not a system Visual Studio install. System Kits still only have NETFXSDK 4.7.2.
+
+MinGW (present):
+  w64devkit g++ 16.2.0 — engine + ngx-probe.exe only.
+  Do not link nvsdk_ngx_s.lib from MinGW. Do not call guessed nvngx.dll CORE exports.
+
+Portable MSVC (no system Visual Studio; preferred on this machine):
+  powershell -File third_party\fetch-msvc.ps1
+  Writes third_party\msvc\setup_x64.bat (MSVC 14.44 + Windows SDK 26100).
+  Then src\ngx_gateway\build-dll-hdr.bat finds it automatically.
+
+System-wide alternative (needs your approval):
+  winget install Microsoft.VisualStudio.2022.BuildTools --override "--wait --passive --add Microsoft.VisualStudio.Workload.VCTools --includeRecommended"
+
+Then:
+  src\ngx_gateway\build-dll-hdr.bat
+  src\ngx_gateway\build-probe.bat
+  src\build-ngx.bat
diff --git a/src/ngx_gateway/VERSIONS.txt b/src/ngx_gateway/VERSIONS.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..130500b81ed05ffb066adcdd228c87716515052d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/ngx_gateway/VERSIONS.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@
+NGX gateway versions (recorded 2026-09-16, updated 2026-10-04)
+==========================================
+
+NVIDIA DLSS SDK
+  third_party/NVIDIA-DLSS  git tag v310.9.1 (DLSS Programming Guide 310.6.0 in doc/)
+  NVSDK_NGX_Version_API    0x15
+  lib  nvsdk_ngx_s.lib     Windows_x86_64/x64   /MT   3782558 bytes
+  runtime nvngx_dlss.dll   Windows_x86_64/rel           58956912 bytes
+  driver nvngx.dll         NVIDIA 591.86 (not copied)
+
+MSVC portable (third_party/msvc, not a system VS install)
+  fetch: third_party/fetch-msvc.ps1  (portable-msvc.py, VS 2022 channel)
+  MSVC 14.44.17.14  Hostx64/x64  cl/link  dumpbin 14.44.35229.0
+  Windows SDK 10.0.26100
+  DLL flags: /LD /O2 /MT /EHsc /std:c++17 /D_CRT_SECURE_NO_WARNINGS
+  Client gateway: src/ngx_gateway/build-dll-hdr.bat -> bin64/ngx-hdr/sauer_ngx.dll (+ nvngx_dlss.dll)
+
+MinGW (engine + ngx-probe)
+  w64devkit g++ 16.2.0
+  every Windows client links engine/hwrt/dlaa-ngx.o (-DHWRT_NGX_GATEWAY); dlaa.cpp has no other path
+  ngx-probe.exe        gcc -std=c11  LoadLibrary of sauer_ngx C ABI
+
+Loading (dlaa.cpp)
+  bin64/ngx-hdr only (sauer_ngx.dll + nvngx_dlss.dll), or the folder in SAUER_NGX_DIR (laboratory).
+  No fallback to bin64/ngx, bin64/ngx-sr, bin64 or any other folder. No Streamline.
+
+ABI
+  SAUER_NGX_ABI_VERSION 5  (bin64/ngx-hdr/sauer_ngx.dll — the client: DLAA/Quality/Balanced/Performance, SDR RGBA8 or
+                            HDR RGBA16F with IsHDR and the 1x1 exposure texture, MVLowRes)
+  SAUER_NGX_ABI_VERSION 4  (bin64/ngx-sr/sauer_ngx.dll — reference clients only; do not build into bin64/ngx-sr)
+  SAUER_NGX_ABI_VERSION 3  (kept as bin64/ngx-sr/sauer_ngx-abi3-*.dll and bin64/ref-quality-abi3 — Quality pair with MVLowRes)
+  SAUER_NGX_ABI_VERSION 2  (kept as bin64/ngx-sr/sauer_ngx-abi2-*.dll — previous Quality pair)
+  SAUER_NGX_ABI_VERSION 1  (bin64/ngx/sauer_ngx.dll — frozen DLAA play client, do not overwrite)
+
+DLSS Programming Guide 310.6.0 conformance (checked 2026-10-04)
+  Init        Init_with_ProjectID, CUSTOM engine, API 0x15; SuperSampling.Available, NeedsUpdatedDriver and
+              FeatureInitResult checked (5.2.6); Shutdown1(device) (5.6/5.7).
+  Logging     NGX level ON, not VERBOSE (3.19).
+  Sizes       GET_OPTIMAL_SETTINGS optimal size for Quality/Balanced/Performance, input = output for DLAA (3.2.1,
+              5.2.8); output at least 64x32 (5.3); feature released and re-created when sizes, mode or HDR change (3.2).
+  Presets     K for DLAA/Quality/Balanced, M for Performance (3.12, the documented defaults).
+  Flags       MVLowRes (render-resolution vectors, 3.6.2); MVJittered 0 (vectors from unjittered matrices);
+              DepthInverted 0 (GL depth, near 0, 3.8.1); IsHDR only for RGBA16F (3.1.2).
+  Exposure    SDR: AutoExposure (3.10). HDR + preset K: 1x1 exposure texture, AutoExposure off (3.9).
+              HDR + preset M: AutoExposure, no exposure texture (3.9: exposure texture only for presets J and K).
+              InPreExposure 1, InExposureScale 1 (3.9.2).
+  Masks       no BiasCurrentColorMask (3.15: not for the current models); no transparency/particle masks.
+  Evaluate    MV scale 1,1 in render pixels, previous - current (3.6.1/3.6.3); jitter in render pixels within
+              +-0.5, Halton(2,3), 16/18/24/32 phases (3.7); InReset on map change, teleport, respawn, mode or
+              output change (3.13); sharpening not used (3.11); inputs sampled, output storage, GENERAL layout (3.4).
+  Mip bias    scene textures (world slots, model skins) get log2(render/display) - 1 while DLAA/DLSS is in use
+              (3.5); FSR and Native keep 0. RT hit shading samples world diffuse at mip 0 (hwrtdiffmip 0).
diff --git a/src/ngx_gateway/build-dll-hdr.bat b/src/ngx_gateway/build-dll-hdr.bat
